# ── KisanDirect AI frontend — environment template ─────────────
# In the single-service deployment the backend serves the built React app
# AND the API on the same origin, so NO environment variables are required.
# The frontend calls "/api" and Socket.IO on its own origin by default.

# Only set these if you deliberately serve the UI and API from different origins:
# VITE_API_URL="https://your-backend.up.railway.app"   # → API calls go here
# VITE_SOCKET_URL="https://your-backend.up.railway.app" # → live updates go here
